      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-826316-b00018",
      "text": "We also published a summary of our reports as one-page files. You can learn more about the Data Narratives Civic Media Observatory here. If you are interested in how we conducted this research and want to know more about the data we collected, access our public dataset.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 18,
      "body_start": 2431,
      "body_end": 2701,
      "source_links": [
        "https://airtable.com/appiUIOgqrjaNG3Od/shr6mDNcNCVlmTgdA/tblSPHuPNtnMGnujw/viwKxp5XQYyrY1YP5?blocks=hide",
        "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1HPftbnbgtt_-qkbPCOWo2fHGMC6Zkm88/view?usp=sharing",
        "https://globalvoices.org/special/data-narratives-cmo/"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-826316-b00019",
      "text": "Read the stories we published based on our research:",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 19,
      "body_start": 2703,
      "body_end": 2755,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "h3",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
